      <title>There's history everywhere you look</title>
      <link>https://www.thewashingtondailynews.com/opinion/theres-history-everywhere-you-look-203c00ff</link>
      <description>February is Black History Month, and I am so grateful I get to share Washington's amazing Black History with the readers of this column. I have created so many ways to share this history through walking tours, historic presentations, in books, magazines, movies, with the creation of historic markers and being featured in the media. I do this because I am so proud of the great heritage and history of local people here in Washington and who have made awesome achievements in this town. Their legacy</description>
